-- One-time data update: Stockholm Marble Grand Prix gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout (Moses, 6 Nov 2026): until now it was physically the same
-- track as Sydney and Lagos Marble Grand Prix. A split start down the Södermalm
-- cliffs, over the Katarina crest and down the Slussen drop (the big feature),
-- round Gamla Stan by the splitter, past City Hall and round Djurgården to
-- Strandvägen; new start shots. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its
-- track record, country records and players' personal bests start again from
-- now (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Stockholm Marble Grand Prix track row changes.

